smb: client: don't check for @leaf_fullpath in match_server()

jira KERNEL-814
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10
commit-author Paulo Alcantara <pc@manguebit.com>
commit 056e91cbc9804f15704b5bc2f02f91c23b1abea1
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10/056e91cb.failed

The matching of DFS connections is already handled by @dfs_conn, so
remove @leaf_fullpath matching altogether.

